---
---

<section id="demo" class="py-16 relative bg-dark-800">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-30">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-primary/30 to-blue-secondary/30"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center">
      <div class="md:w-1/2 animate-on-scroll">
        <img 
          src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/7947541/pexels-photo-7947541.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750&dpr=1" 
          alt="Dashboard de ZinkERP" 
          class="rounded-lg shadow-xl"
        />
      </div>
      
      <div class="md:w-1/2 animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">
          Comenzá ahora con tu 
          <span class="text-blue-primary">demo sin cargo</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">
          Descubrí cómo ZinkERP puede transformar la gestión de tu negocio. Te guiamos en todo el proceso.
        </p>
        
        <div class="bg-dark-700 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-dark-600">
          <form class="space-y-4">
            <div>
              <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 mb-1">Email empresarial</label>
              <input 
                type="email" 
                id="email" 
                placeholder="tu@empresa.com" 
                class="w-full px-4 py-2 bg-dark-600 border border-dark-500 rounded-md focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-primary focus:border-blue-primary text-white"
              />
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <label for="company" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 mb-1">Nombre de empresa</label>
              <input 
                type="text" 
                id="company" 
                placeholder="Tu empresa" 
                class="w-full px-4 py-2 bg-dark-600 border border-dark-500 rounded-md focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-primary focus:border-blue-primary text-white"
              />
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex items-center">
              <input 
                type="checkbox" 
                id="terms" 
                class="h-4 w-4 text-blue-primary focus:ring-blue-primary border-dark-500 rounded"
              />
              <label for="terms" class="ml-2 block text-sm text-gray-300">
                Acepto los <a href="#" class="text-blue-primary hover:text-blue-secondary">términos y condiciones</a>
              </label>
            </div>
            
            <button 
              type="submit" 
              class="w-full bg-blue-primary hover:bg-blue-primary/90 text-white font-medium py-2 px-4 rounded-md transition-colors duration-300"
            >
              Solicitar demo
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>